# Indicators of Compromise (IOCs)

The following Indicators of Compromise (IOCs) were identified during the **TryHackMe: Boogeyman 3 Incident Response** investigation.

The investigation focused on analyzing attacker activity using ELK, Sysmon telemetry, process execution logs, PowerShell activity, credential dumping, lateral movement, and C2 communication.

