# Incident Summary

The attacker gained initial access through a malicious document attachment.

The attack chain included:

1. Payload execution through mshta.exe
2. Payload implantation using xcopy
3. Execution through rundll32.exe
4. Persistence via scheduled task
5. C2 communication
6. UAC bypass using fodhelper.exe
7. Credential dumping using Mimikatz
8. Lateral movement using stolen credentials
9. Domain compromise through DCSync
10. Ransomware deployment attempt
